  "subtitle": "Compact adjustable seven-bit index",
  "description": "A compact one-row holder with a comma-delimited bit list for adding, removing, or resizing holes. It defaults to 1/8, 5/32, 3/16, 1/4, 5/16, 3/8, and 1/2 inch, with rounded corners and softened outer and hole-entry edges.",
  "viewer": "drill-bit-holder-v1",
  "stl": {
    "fileName": "drill-bit-holder.stl",
    "sourceName": "procedural-seven-bit-holder.stl",
